WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:01.620
Feel that chill?

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.140
It's not the end of summer it's the start
of the Halloween season.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:09.900
Netflix already features a huge lineup of
horror titles primed for a Halloween binge

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.140
session, but the service is also loading up
on brand new horror.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.660
Here are the scariest new releases hitting
Netflix this October.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.500
Creeped Out: Season 1

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:23.850
This horror-themed coproduction between Netflix
and the BBC may come across as a Black Mirror

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:28.480
for kids, but...well, okay, on second thought,
that's exactly what this is.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:33.300
As an anthology series, each episode tells
its own bite-sized horror story with different

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.000
characters and different settings.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:39.890
The twist is that all the stories are connected
by a creepy, masked man who's out to "collect"

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.540
mankind's darkest tales.

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:46.780
The episodes explore everything from psychological
horror to the supernatural, preying on your

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:50.540
darkest fears and giving you plenty of reasons
to sleep with the lights on.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.940
The first season of Creeped Out debuted on
BBC in 2017, but October 4th will mark the

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:59.180
first time the series is available for an
international audience.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:00.480
Malevolent

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.720
Here's an interesting twist on the haunted
house genre.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:08.190
Malevolent follows a brother-and-sister scam
artist duo who trick people into thinking

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:11.780
their houses are haunted, then go in and pretend
to drive the ghosts away.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:16.299
Business is booming until they run into an
actual haunted house and discover that real

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:19.040
ghosts are a lot more dangerous than the fake
ones.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.560
Look for it on October 5th.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:21.920
Apostle

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:26.540
Gareth Evans is best known in the film world
for writing and directing the action-packed

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:29.440
martial arts film The Raid and its sequel,
The Raid 2.

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:34.600
But with Apostle, Evans is making a departure
from his usual action fare and taking a deep

00:01:34.619 --> 00:01:36.329
dive into cult-based horror.

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:40.920
At the turn of the 20th century, a sadistic
cult kidnaps a young woman and takes her to

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:44.720
their remote island for, uh, culty purposes.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:48.020
What they didn't count on was the woman's
brother coming after her.

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:51.990
If the trailer is any indication, that's just
the start of the mayhem you can expect from

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:52.480
Apostle.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.040
Strap in on October 12th.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.940
The Haunting of Hill House: Season 1

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:01.120
Get ready for all the horror you can stomach
with The Haunting of Hill House.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:06.620
Based on the classic novel by Shirley Jackson,
the series stars Carla Gugino and Michiel

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:10.020
Huisman and centers on a family that comes
back to the haunted house where they grew

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:10.520
up.

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:14.700
The Haunting of Hill House comes from Mike
Flanagan, who's recently been making waves

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:19.780
in the horror world with Netflix's Gerald's
Game and his under-the-radar horror gems Oculus

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:20.280
and Hush.

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:24.560
Look for the first season of The Haunting
of Hill House to hit Netflix on October 12th.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.100
Haunted: Season 1

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:29.260
If fiction isn't your speed this Halloween,
fear not!

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:33.140
Netflix is also bringing in a horror series
based on true events.

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:34.180
Well, sort of.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:39.420
Haunted sits down with people who claim to
have first-hand accounts of paranormal experiences.

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:44.780
Ghosts, aliens, monsters in the night it's
all in here, and the series will recreate

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:49.600
those stories in terrifying detail, fleshing
out the horror in imaginative new ways.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:54.980
Part true terror and part cinematic creepfest,
Haunted is bound to offer plenty of reasons

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.769
to sit in front of the TV all day.

00:02:56.769 --> 00:02:59.080
Tune in when Season 1 drops on October 19th.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:01.280
The Chilling Adventures of Sabrina

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:06.560
Maybe you want a horror-tinged version of
the late '90s sitcom Sabrina the Teenage Witch,

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:10.990
or maybe you dig those teenaged horndogs on
Riverdale, but you want more pacts with the

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:11.480
devil.

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:16.540
Well good news: The Chilling Adventures of
Sabrina puts the classic Archie comics character

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.040
smack dab in the middle of a battle against
evil.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:23.420
According to Entertainment Weekly, The Chilling
Adventures of Sabrina was originally meant

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:25.600
to act as a sister series to Riverdale.

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:30.670
Once production moved over to Netflix, however,
the idea of bridging the two shows was put

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:31.540
on the back burner.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.800
It's still possible, but for now, The Chilling
Adventures of Sabrina stands completely on

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:36.300
its own.

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:39.080
Take a look when it arrives on October 26th.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:40.980
Castlevania: Season 2

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:45.740
The first season of Netflix's hyper-violent
Castlevania adaptation came out of the gates

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:49.360
with middling reviews, but quickly built up
a large fan following.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:54.980
The story follows Trevor Belmont, the protagonist
of Castlevania III: Dracula's Curse, as he

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:57.340
battles the supernatural forces of Dracula.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:03.740
"Trevor, join us. Sure, by the way you're all going to
die."

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:08.799
By all accounts, Season 2 will pick up right
where the first season left off, drawing viewers

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:12.170
further into the horrifying world of 15th-century
Wallachia.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:17.260
With horror and action in equal measure, Castlevania
makes the perfect show to binge this Halloween

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:17.760
season.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.260
If you haven't caught the first season yet,
you'll have plenty of time to catch up before

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.700
Season 2 lands on October 26th.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.140
New Thriller Movies

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:30.370
While Netflix will be putting out their usual
selection of films and shows from all genres,

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.240
Halloween calls for a special focus on the
horror-based titles.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:38.430
From horror-classic The Shining arriving on
the 1st to The Exorcism of Molly Hartley,

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:41.720
which hits Netflix on the 4th, there's a lot
of new stuff on the way.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:46.500
And while they aren't pure horror, Stephen
King's supernatural drama The Green Mile and

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:50.060
the first two films in the Blade trilogy and
also arrive on the 1st.

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:53.600
What better time than Halloween to relive
those classics?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:58.120
"Some motherf------ always trying to iceskate
uphill."

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.560
Oh, Blade.

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:00.460
We missed you.

